    "catalogue_description": "It took me about seven months becasue of college and my job but without further ado, i release Slums! Its a small ish map but i packed it with features and stuff to keep you busy! Explore the small alleyways and open front \u201cyards\u201d of a poor, post apocalyptic slum! Use kinda overpowered weapons to have a great time and beat the map! Features!! Weapons from MW3, MW2, AW, and CSGO! 11 perks! a freaking PANZER SOLDAT AND PATROL SOLDAT! napalm boss zombie! a custom powerup! a buyable ending! Find the hidden keys to open the locked door to pack a punch! T4M is required!",
